        <img
          src="/images/landing/essen-ikan-120x/target-ikan-kolam.webp"
          alt="Cocok untuk ikan lele, nila, mas, patin, mujair dan ikan kolam air tawar lainnya"
          class="w-full h-auto aspect-square object-contain block"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          width="1024"
          height="1024"
        />
      </div>

      <!-- Grid Target Ikan -->
      <div class="mt-5 px-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-left">
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-2xs">
          <p class="font-extrabold text-blue-900 text-[13px]">Ikan Lele &amp; Patin</p>
          <p class="text-[11.5px] text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-snug">Sensitif pada aroma amis pekat, langsung menyambar umpan di dasar air.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-2xs">
          <p class="font-extrabold text-blue-900 text-[13px]">Ikan Mas &amp; Nila</p>
          <p class="text-[11.5px] text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-snug">Penciuman tajam, terpikat asam amino fermentasi yang memicu rasa lapar.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-2xs">
          <p class="font-extrabold text-blue-900 text-[13px]">Ikan Bawal &amp; Mujair</p>
          <p class="text-[11.5px] text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-snug">Agresif menyambar umpan di kolom tengah air dengan respon sambaran kilat.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-2xs">
          <p class="font-extrabold text-blue-900 text-[13px]">Kolam Harian &amp; Lomba</p>
          <p class="text-[11.5px] text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-snug">Andalan juara lapak untuk mengunci titik makan ikan saat persaingan ketat.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>



    <!-- ═══ 7. SECTION: REAL TESTIMONI PEMANCING ═══ -->
    <section class="border-t border-slate-100 bg-slate-50/90 pt-8 pb-10 text-center">
      <div class="px-5">
        <h2 class="text-[clamp(21px,6.5vw,25px)] font-black text-slate-950 tracking-tight leading-[1.22]">
          Kisah Nyata Para Pemancing Lapak
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[13px] sm:text-[13.5px] text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mt-2 max-w-[420px] mx-auto text-center mb-6">
          Cerita jujur dari para angler yang berhasil bawa pulang tangkapan melimpah dan jadi juara lapak:
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- IMAGE: BUKTI TANGKAPAN LAPAK MELIMPAH (RATIO 3:2) -->
      <div class="mt-6 relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-slate-950 aspect-[3/2] shadow-md border-y border-slate-200 mb-6">
        <img
          src="/images/landing/essen-ikan-120x/hasil-tangkapan.webp"
          alt="Bukti korang pancing penuh tangkapan ikan babon di kolam pemancingan"
          class="h-full w-full object-cover object-center block"
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          width="1264"
          height="848"
        />
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950/95 via-slate-950/70 to-transparent px-3 pt-6 pb-2 text-center">
          <p class="text-[11.5px] sm:text-[12px] font-bold text-amber-300">
            Hasil Nyata Lapak Kolam: Korang Penuh, Babon Melimpah
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="px-4 sm:px-5 space-y-3 text-left">
        <!-- Testimoni 1 -->
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/90 shadow-2xs">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-slate-100">
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold text-[13.5px] text-slate-950">Pak Yudi Kurniawan (42 th)</p>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-medium">Pemancing Harian Lele • Bandung</p>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[11px] font-extrabold text-amber-500 bg-amber-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-amber-200/60">Rating 5/5</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[12.5px] text-slate-700 mt-2.5 leading-relaxed font-normal">
            “Biasanya kalau mancing lele malam sering boncos cuma dapat anak lele kecil. Kemarin iseng coba tetes 1 kapsul Fertani ke umpan cacing. Baru 10 menit pelampung langsung amblas ditarik lele babon 3,2 kg! Joran melengkung tajam, puas luar biasa!”
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Testimoni 2 -->
        <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/90 shadow-2xs">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-slate-100">
